    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a finalized allocation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Finalized allocations must be passed to the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_j_i_t_link_memory_manager" kindref="compound">JITLinkMemoryManager</ref>:deallocate method prior to being destroyed.</para>
<para>The interpretation of the Address associated with the finalized allocation is up to the memory manager implementation. Common options are using the base address of the allocation, or the address of a memory management object that tracks the allocation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
